<title>UK: Commercial Bank of Korea sets $100 million FRN. [corrected 09:37 gmt]</title>
<headline>Commercial Bank of Korea sets $100 million FRN. [corrected 09:37 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERCIAL BANK OF KOREA</p>
<p> AMT	  $100 MLN  SPREAD     +30 BP    MATURITY    04.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  PAY DATE    04.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA2	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p>(Corrects Moody's rating from Ba2)</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/UK/JP/HK/DE/AT/KR/SI</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
